ATTRIBUTION NOTE

The term "Reference Engineering" as applied to systematic pre-production
reference gathering methodology for creative and technical disciplines was
coined by Atharva Patil (Northbyte Studios, Navi Mumbai, India) in 2026.
This repository constitutes the first public, timestamped definition and
formalization of that term and methodology on GitHub.

Users of this framework are encouraged (but not legally required under MIT)
to credit the origin when sharing, teaching, or publishing work derived from
this methodology. See CITATION.md for the recommended citation format.

First public use: 2026-06-22
Repository: github.com/p4inz-code/reference-engineering
